(7114808, 1085541, 129807, '<td valign="top">(voted earlier, coming back to comment)<br/>My team and I were marveling at the dearth of comments in this challenge so I thought I would at least attempt to correct that a little:<br/>I really like this image; it is one of my top rated. I love how you have used the play of light and shadow to define the fragility of the leaf.</td>', '(voted earlier, coming back to comment)My team and I were marveling at the dearth of comments in this challenge so I thought I would at least attempt to correct that a little:I really like this image; it is one of my top rated. I love how you have used the play of light and shadow to define the fragility of the leaf.', '2013-10-12 07:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7114809, 1085599, 129807, '<td valign="top">(voted earlier, coming back to comment)<br/>My team and I were marveling at the dearth of comments in this challenge so I thought I would at least attempt to correct that a little:<br/>Excellent image and one of my top picks. Composition and colour are extremely well thought out and you have nailed the technicals. Wonderful.</td>', '(voted earlier, coming back to comment)My team and I were marveling at the dearth of comments in this challenge so I thought I would at least attempt to correct that a little:Excellent image and one of my top picks. Composition and colour are extremely well thought out and you have nailed the technicals. Wonderful.', '2013-10-12 07:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7114810, 1085269, 129807, '<td valign="top">(voted earlier, coming back to comment)<br/>My team and I were marveling at the dearth of comments in this challenge so I thought I would at least attempt to correct that a little:<br/>To be honest, at first I didn''t like this. In particular, the border, but meh, that can change so easily. I wanted a little more definition in the image itself and a little less raindrop. But then, I stayed. I looked more. Not many images entice me to linger. As I peered into the colourscape, I realised that I have spent many hours staring at views similar to this, dreaming dreams, planning plans. I realised that your concept and image made me think, dream, remember. Thank you.</td>', '(voted earlier, coming back to comment)My team and I were marveling at the dearth of comments in this challenge so I thought I would at least attempt to correct that a little:To be honest, at first I didn''t like this. In particular, the border, but meh, that can change so easily. I wanted a little more definition in the image itself and a little less raindrop. But then, I stayed. I looked more. Not many images entice me to linger. As I peered into the colourscape, I realised that I have spent many hours staring at views similar to this, dreaming dreams, planning plans. I realised that your concept and image made me think, dream, remember. Thank you.', '2013-10-12 07:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7114812, 1085624, 129807, '<td valign="top">(voted earlier, coming back to comment)<br/>My team and I were marveling at the dearth of comments in this challenge so I thought I would at least attempt to correct that a little:<br/>What a wonderfully appropriate subject to capture. I like your composition and use of the space above and behind to enhance the isolation of the slow death.</td>', '(voted earlier, coming back to comment)My team and I were marveling at the dearth of comments in this challenge so I thought I would at least attempt to correct that a little:What a wonderfully appropriate subject to capture. I like your composition and use of the space above and behind to enhance the isolation of the slow death.', '2013-10-12 07:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
