(7115151, 1085624, 136989, '<td valign="top">It''s always amazed me at how resilient these trees can be.  Broken limbs, lightening strikes ... No matter the hardship they persevere.  My parents even have an oak stump in their backyard that was completely severed by a tornado and it is still trying.  Never the same but trying.  Love the fog in and comp of your photo.  Beautiful.  My favorite in this challenge.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1082013" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg"/></a></td>', 'It''s always amazed me at how resilient these trees can be.  Broken limbs, lightening strikes ... No matter the hardship they persevere.  My parents even have an oak stump in their backyard that was completely severed by a tornado and it is still trying.  Never the same but trying.  Love the fog in and comp of your photo.  Beautiful.  My favorite in this challenge.', '2013-10-13 14:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
